            }
          ],
          "content": "Source: LCA glossary (wey: 'usually equal to twelve stone or c. 300 lb.'). Note: self-inconsistent: 12 stone is 168 lb, not c. 300 lb; varies by commodity. Not exact: approximate, or one of several readings. One of 2 readings the sources give for this unit; none is preferred"
        }
      ]
    },
