              "_label": "brief texts"
            }
          ],
          "content": "Source: LCA glossary (wey: 'usually equal to twelve stone or c. 300 lb.'). Note: the same description's other reading; 300 lb is not twelve stone (168 lb). Not exact: approximate, or one of several readings. One of 2 readings the sources give for this unit; none is preferred"
